{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CyclingArcadeRaceSimulator for ANT+ FEC Devices</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A challenging and entertaining cycling simulation for ambitious riders.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is all about having fun on your bike \u2013 just hop on and ride! Opponents automatically adjust to your fitness level (FTP), ensuring you're always challenged at the right intensity. Whether you're racing on a Formula 1 circuit, climbing steep mountain roads, or battling through a scorching desert \u2013 there's something here for every type of rider.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support for ANT+ FEC compatible smart trainers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic opponent difficulty based on your fitness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of tracks with unique challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focus on fun, accessibility, and long-term motivation</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"10 Miles","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3750840/3ea6cb076dd25bedd97e076738cd12ba01629a82.jpg"},{"name":"40 km","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3750840/50d8658da57947e67456cb182b29ad435460a89e.jpg"},{"name":"100 km Total","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3750840/39a4df45b925a645fcf74bf56082a28294cddba9.jpg"},{"name":"100 Miles Total","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3750840/9ab7576b533757727bd48f59cae41f0c7d506a54.jpg"},{"name":"Everest","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3750840/b1c0fe3b34b8a9255cb73899397c7c4713453f63.jpg"},{"name":"800 Watts Reached","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3750840/77e07b3d855d379b7e50513d8410222b68772ba3.j